  "main_caveat": "Formalized. The printed Appendix and DERIVED kappa family have compiled continuous per-individual, unit-budget source-rule bridges. Theorem 9's compiled fluid execution includes full allocation unless all eligible bidders are saturated and is pinned to the concrete bid-1/m hard family with exact round masses and vanishing individual bids. Section 4 has a compiled cohort-fluid execution whose realized final-type masses make the factor-LP rows tight and determine its revenue. The focused target `lake build MSVV07AdWords` passes. Generated protocol sidecars, the DAG, and independent human row review still require serialized refresh; that is validation freshness, not a mathematical formalization gap. Theorem 8's finite +1 shift and the Appendix's 0.62 arithmetic and false phase-2 exhaustion are ordinary formalized notes whose corrected endpoints are unchanged; none calls for formalized-with-caveat status.",
